BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:July Speaker Series & Meeting - Leicester Dems
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260728T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260728T170000
UID:879f3eb47569e84356fa5404c1322a6d@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/leicester_20260628185730897736.png
DESCRIPTION:Join us for updates from Representatives Lindsey Prather and E
 ric Ager fresh from the summer legislative session. Learn more about the s
 tate budget\, property taxes\, and what is happening in Raleigh\, then sta
 y for a conversation about the work ahead as we head toward November. Who 
 should attend: Any local Democrats or left-leaning Unaffiliated voters who
  are interested in what's happening in Raleigh\, and how that affects us i
 n WNC.
LOCATION:Leicester Public Library\, 1561 Alexander Rd\, Leicester\, NC\, 2
 8748
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/980376/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
