DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T090000
UID:975c48cc1448fe5ff999d4acfd149efb@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Burroughs%20Canvass%20July%2025_20260708162001494077.png
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we canvass for Jeffrey Burroughs for City Council! 
 We'll gather to pick up campaign materials then walk in Asheville neighbor
 hoods to connect with voters. You will receive training before you arrive 
 so whether you're a seasoned volunteer or trying this for the first time\,
  you'll have everything you need to feel comfortable and confident. Come e
 njoy a walk\, meet fellow supporters\, and help us spread Jeffrey's vision
  for Asheville one conversation at a time. No experience necessary. Bri
LOCATION:Asheville\, NC
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/986233/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
